 "public allInstancesOf: b <Behavior> ^<Array> = (\n			(* All (exact) instances of behavior b, found via the object table maintained by the vmmirror. Same API as MirrorsForPrimordialSoup, where this is primitive 96. *)\n\n			^vmmirror allInstancesOf: b\n		)",
 "class IRBasedClassDeclarationBuilder fromIR: ir <IntermediateClassDeclaration> existingMixin: m <Mixin> within: enclosing <ClassDeclarationBuilder> = ClassDeclarationBuilder forExistingMixin: m\n		within: enclosing (\n		|\n			prvtIR <IntermediateClassDeclaration> = ir.\n		|\n	)",
