 "public = other <Object> ^<Boolean> = (\n			^other isPoint and: [ x = other x and: [ y = other y ] ]\n		)",
 "public corner: corner <Point> ^<Rectangle> = (\n			^Rectangle origin: self corner: corner\n		)",
