 "class FontsForHTML5 usingPlatform: p\n(* :exemplar: platform fonts *)\n = Object new (\n	(* Font support for Newspeak.\n\nCopyright Gene Z. Ragan 2021 *)\n	\n	|\n		private Map = p collections Map.\n		private DefaultSize <Float> = 12.0.\n	|\n)",
